{"4830350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Dead Matrix Chamber", "steam_appid": 4830350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a sci-fi roguelike survival adventure game. You must roll dice in four different colors to gain points, unlock a series of rooms filled with deadly and terrifying traps, and find the final exit. At the same time, you must carefully manage your HP, stamina, and sanity before they are completely depleted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Four-Color Dice】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830350/extras/ae23d1baae0d5e4e209285cb29204601.poster.avif?t=1783939594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830350/extras/ae23d1baae0d5e4e209285cb29204601.webm?t=1783939594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830350/extras/ae23d1baae0d5e4e209285cb29204601.mp4?t=1783939594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, you roll a set of four-color dice and gain points in four different colors. These points accumulate over time and are used to unlock doors of the matching color. Be careful: in every run, the color distribution and required point values of each room’s door locks are randomized, though each room’s four doors will always have four different colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The farther you move toward the outer edge of the matrix, the higher the dice point requirements become. Planning your route carefully is the key to saving points. When your sanity reaches zero, you will no longer be able to roll for points, which may leave you trapped in place forever until death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Equipment】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830350/extras/fa3958790a50013dcd105f70ddb854c2.poster.avif?t=1783939594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830350/extras/fa3958790a50013dcd105f70ddb854c2.webm?t=1783939594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830350/extras/fa3958790a50013dcd105f70ddb854c2.mp4?t=1783939594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have three equipment slots. You receive equipment at the start of the game and as rewards from certain rooms. These items may provide bonuses related to dice points, HP, stamina, sanity, and more. Equipment is the biggest source of unpredictability in the game. You need to trigger equipment effects as much as possible to gain extra benefits, or combine equipment from different slots to create powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Trap Rooms】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830350/extras/3947c74984e8d75c9a36130bed6238ab.poster.avif?t=1783939594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830350/extras/3947c74984e8d75c9a36130bed6238ab.webm?t=1783939594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830350/extras/3947c74984e8d75c9a36130bed6238ab.mp4?t=1783939594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each matrix contains dozens of different types of trap rooms. Most of them will damage your HP, drain your stamina, or crush your sanity whenever you enter. A small number of rooms can restore HP, stamina, or sanity, but each of them can only be used once, so you may want to save them for critical moments.Teleportation rooms are also dangerous. They may send you straight into a deadly room, but sometimes they are the best way to move quickly across the matrix. Everything depends on your strategy — and your luck.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a sci-fi roguelike survival adventure game. You must roll dice in four different colors to gain points, unlock a series of rooms filled with deadly and terrifying traps, and find the final exit. At the same time, you must carefully manage your HP, stamina, and sanity before they are completely depleted.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Four-Color Dice】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830350/extras/ae23d1baae0d5e4e209285cb29204601.poster.avif?t=1783939594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830350/extras/ae23d1baae0d5e4e209285cb29204601.webm?t=1783939594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830350/extras/ae23d1baae0d5e4e209285cb29204601.mp4?t=1783939594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each turn, you roll a set of four-color dice and gain points in four different colors. These points accumulate over time and are used to unlock doors of the matching color. Be careful: in every run, the color distribution and required point values of each room’s door locks are randomized, though each room’s four doors will always have four different colors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The farther you move toward the outer edge of the matrix, the higher the dice point requirements become. Planning your route carefully is the key to saving points. When your sanity reaches zero, you will no longer be able to roll for points, which may leave you trapped in place forever until death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Equipment】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830350/extras/fa3958790a50013dcd105f70ddb854c2.poster.avif?t=1783939594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830350/extras/fa3958790a50013dcd105f70ddb854c2.webm?t=1783939594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830350/extras/fa3958790a50013dcd105f70ddb854c2.mp4?t=1783939594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have three equipment slots. You receive equipment at the start of the game and as rewards from certain rooms. These items may provide bonuses related to dice points, HP, stamina, sanity, and more. Equipment is the biggest source of unpredictability in the game. You need to trigger equipment effects as much as possible to gain extra benefits, or combine equipment from different slots to create powerful synergies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >【Trap Rooms】</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830350/extras/3947c74984e8d75c9a36130bed6238ab.poster.avif?t=1783939594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830350/extras/3947c74984e8d75c9a36130bed6238ab.webm?t=1783939594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830350/extras/3947c74984e8d75c9a36130bed6238ab.mp4?t=1783939594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each matrix contains dozens of different types of trap rooms. Most of them will damage your HP, drain your stamina, or crush your sanity whenever you enter. A small number of rooms can restore HP, stamina, or sanity, but each of them can only be used once, so you may want to save them for critical moments.Teleportation rooms are also dangerous. They may send you straight into a deadly room, but sometimes they are the best way to move quickly across the matrix. Everything depends on your strategy — and your luck.</p>", "short_description": "Escape a deadly sci-fi room matrix in this roguelike survival game. Roll colored dice, unlock matching doors, preview nearby dangers, and manage health, sanity, and turns. Random rooms and gear make every run a tense new bid for freedom.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830350/d701ba2070f0511cf97be69aa69336ebaed7286b/header.jpg?t=1783939594", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830350/e10c6c23c87a4635013a4e50efe63f011b62e7da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783939594", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4830350/e10c6c23c87a4635013a4e50efe63f011b62e7da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783939594", "website": "https://www.suji.ink", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> windows7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> any<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 500 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> any<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> any<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> any</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><